# These directories hold test fixtures captured verbatim from reference
# implementations - raw encoded/decoded bytes, not human-authored text. Some of those
# byte sequences happen to contain a lone LF (0x0A); without this, Git's line-ending
# conversion (autocrlf) can silently rewrite it to CRLF on checkout, corrupting the
# fixture without the tracked blob ever changing. Disable text conversion for them.
src/CyberDot.Encoding.Base2048.Tests/test-data/** -text
src/CyberDot.Encoding.Base65536.Tests/Bad/** -text
src/CyberDot.Encoding.Base65536.Tests/DoubledBytes/** -text
src/CyberDot.Encoding.Base65536.Tests/IgnoreGarbage/** -text
src/CyberDot.Encoding.Base65536.Tests/Pairs/** -text
src/CyberDot.Encoding.Base65536.Tests/SingleBytes/** -text
